intent: Keep the Office record on idle exit; a revived server reuses the previous port and token so open tabs reconnect; ensureBackgroundOffice opens a page only when the URL changed; liveness probes a cheap token-gated /health endpoint instead of the full snapshot.
criteria:
- revive-same-url: After the Office server exits (idle) and a hook revives it, the revived server answers on the previous URL (same port and token), so an open tab reconnects, and ensureBackgroundOffice does not open another browser page.
- slow-snapshot-live: A live Office server whose snapshot takes longer than the liveness timeout is still detected as live by readLiveOffice, so ensure never boots it out and starts a second one.
- unit-tests: npm test passes, including the updated Office server tests for record reuse.
